# The image builds from an allow list: the workspace's manifests, the packages, the plugins, the
# bundled skills and the license files. Nothing else reaches the build, so no `.env` file, key,
# keystore, state folder, local note or git history can land in a layer.
*
!.npmrc
!LICENSE
!NOTICES.md
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!tsconfig.json
!turbo.json
!packages/
!plugins/
!skills/

# Built and installed files are made again inside the build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
packages/cli/skills

# Secrets and keys, should one sit inside an allowed folder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.keystore
**/keystore*
**/.binference
